{
  "capture": "telemetry/mg90-d__dev-v006-2A-D",
  "notes": "stage 4 winding-temperature of mg90-d on dev-v006-2A-D, no capture of its own: stage 3's sittings, 521 sweeps over four days. One servo, one board. Reads: 20 ms sub-windows of streamed driven segments of the stopped-rotor sweeps through oscnb.winding.gate, R = (V_c - V0) / i_w under oscnb.speed.construct with stage 1's in-drive offset; blocks of 100 ms at read_current_floor_a or more, bridged seats (under 0.9 of R0) out. Floors: same seat = a sub-window's sd about its window's line, median and 10 to 90 %; across seats = pooled sd of the first read of repeated stop, rail and duty chains, median and range over stop-1, rails-7, meter-8. Heat: oscnb.winding.heat, joules at R0, bounds from its named constants. Estimate: oscnb.winding.run from a zero state over every piece; residual ln R - ln R(T_w), seat-referenced (group mean out, weights 0.10 % same seat, 0.70 % across seats); fit sittings 1, 6, 9, held out 2, 3, 5, 10. one_node_*: value the fit sittings, lo/hi over the fit, the swap, all and the unstreamed heat at its bounds, fold_lo/hi over the three fits, stat_factor the fit's se as a factor. two_node_slow_c: tau2 / gain2 over tau2 35 to 263 s on the fit sittings and on all, median and range; the slow gain and tau are not graded. load anchored: each load block's residual less its group's reads under 0.25 A, across seats; speed = residual x R0 i / Ke. Candidates: a_ntc the NTC alone, b_one one node, c_two two nodes.",
